# Werkbench (personal agentic harness — lives at user level, never commits)
# Mike's harness now lives at ~/Desktop/Code Projects/Werkbench/
# (separate from project repo, synced via pCloud + private git repo).
# These project-local overlays are gitignored:
.werkbench-marker
.werkbench-cache/
# Legacy: keep the project-level Werkbench/ pattern as a safety net
# in case anyone accidentally puts framework files in the project tree.
Werkbench/

# Personal scratch (downloads, screenshots, temp QA docs, review materials).
# Local-only — never commits. Add `.misc/**` to pCloud Block Sync to keep
# it off cloud sync as well.
.misc/

